{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30400","headline":"山阳即席献裴中丞 · 赵嘏","name":"山阳即席献裴中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早年天上见清尘，今日楼中醉一春。\n暂肯剖符临水石，几曾焚笔动星辰。\n琼台雪映迢迢鹤，蓬岛波横浩浩津。\n好是仙家羽衣使，欲敎垂涕问何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}